# this is an example mime.types.  if located in one of evidence's directories,
# it will NOT be used!  evidence, like many other programs, expects a file
# "mime.types" in /etc -- you likely already have that file and do not need
# to fiddle with it.  if you are certain that you do not have that file at
# all, you may copy this file to /etc as a temporary solution. that's all. : )

